WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.358 --> 00:00:03.354
(booming thunder)

00:00:03.354 --> 00:00:04.604
- Hello Believe Nation.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.104
I made the Mentor Me series

00:00:06.104 --> 00:00:08.200
to try to hang around and
spend a little bit more time

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.324
with people who've done a lot more than us

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:12.321
and hopefully their mindset,

00:00:12.321 --> 00:00:13.500
their ways of thinking,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.323
some of their beliefs kind of seep into us

00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:19.624
to help us become the
best version of ourselves.

00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:21.644
So today we're going to
learn from Eckhart Tolle

00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:23.722
on the Power of Now motivation.

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:24.555
And as always guys,

00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:26.052
if Eckhart says something that really,

00:00:26.052 --> 00:00:27.464
really resinates with you,

00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:29.218
please leave it in the comments below

00:00:29.218 --> 00:00:30.265
and put quotes around it so other people

00:00:30.265 --> 00:00:33.022
could be inspired as well, enjoy.

00:00:33.022 --> 00:00:35.439
(soft music)

00:00:46.124 --> 00:00:49.624
- The ego, of course, looks for liberation

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.547
from its unsatisfying,
unsatisfactory state.

00:00:56.836 --> 00:01:00.503
It looks at the ego, knows, this is,

00:01:00.503 --> 00:01:03.574
what's, it knows something is missing,

00:01:03.574 --> 00:01:07.003
but always looks in the wrong place,

00:01:07.003 --> 00:01:08.876
as we already state.

00:01:08.876 --> 00:01:11.958
It looks there but never here.

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:14.719
So it never goes deep into life,

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:16.124
into what it is,

00:01:16.124 --> 00:01:20.291
it ignores the simple
reality of the present moment

00:01:21.482 --> 00:01:25.649
and looks in the, towards the
next moment for satisfaction,

00:01:27.484 --> 00:01:31.651
for that which I can add
that will make me complete.

00:01:32.924 --> 00:01:35.591
Hence its obsession with future,

00:01:37.283 --> 00:01:39.361
with the next moment

00:01:39.361 --> 00:01:42.380
and hence everybody lives that way,

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.797
almost everybody,

00:01:45.281 --> 00:01:49.261
as if the next moment were more important

00:01:49.261 --> 00:01:50.803
than this moment

00:01:50.803 --> 00:01:52.657
and isn't that strange?

00:01:52.657 --> 00:01:55.342
It's a form of mental illness because

00:01:55.342 --> 00:01:58.259
the next moment doesn't even exist,

00:01:59.841 --> 00:02:02.591
except as a thought in your head.

00:02:04.102 --> 00:02:08.160
That's the only absolute
reality that future has,

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:12.061
is it exists as a thought in your head

00:02:12.061 --> 00:02:13.860
and it is fine.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.982
As for practical purposes,
it's a helpful thought

00:02:17.982 --> 00:02:19.903
that there is such a thing as future,

00:02:19.903 --> 00:02:22.440
because it enables you
to make an appointment.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.681
(audience laughing)

00:02:24.681 --> 00:02:26.382
So it's helpful,

00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:28.802
we got here because of future,

00:02:28.802 --> 00:02:30.439
because of this thought that

00:02:30.439 --> 00:02:32.841
there is such a thing as future.

00:02:32.841 --> 00:02:33.882
But there isn't,

00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:36.343
because nobody has ever
seen it or touched it

00:02:36.343 --> 00:02:37.916
or experienced it

00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:40.401
and since nobody has ever seen,
touched or experienced it,

00:02:40.401 --> 00:02:43.601
we can assume that it doesn't exist

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.656
and obviously it doesn't,

00:02:45.656 --> 00:02:47.717
because when the future comes,

00:02:47.717 --> 00:02:49.197
it's the now.

00:02:49.197 --> 00:02:51.982
The next moment comes
that you wanted to get to

00:02:51.982 --> 00:02:53.822
and finally you get there

00:02:53.822 --> 00:02:56.755
and it turns out, well it's the now again.

00:02:56.755 --> 00:02:59.755
(audience laughing)

00:03:03.263 --> 00:03:05.277
And the ego runs away from it,

00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:09.198
not realizing that what
it has been looking for

00:03:09.198 --> 00:03:10.448
is hiding here,

00:03:12.739 --> 00:03:15.656
no matter what form this now takes.

00:03:19.764 --> 00:03:23.097
It is hiding where the conditioned mind,

00:03:23.944 --> 00:03:27.444
which is the ego, has never really looked.

00:03:29.039 --> 00:03:33.206
It always made the now at
best into a means to an end.

00:03:35.858 --> 00:03:37.702
Okay, this now, I need this now

00:03:37.702 --> 00:03:41.504
because it enables me to get
to that more important moment,

00:03:41.504 --> 00:03:44.302
which is the future, okay.

00:03:44.302 --> 00:03:45.881
A stepping stone,

00:03:45.881 --> 00:03:47.048
best of times.

00:03:48.441 --> 00:03:52.795
All the ego had to reduce
the now to an obstacle

00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:56.619
and some people, some people
that is their normal existence.

00:03:56.619 --> 00:04:00.440
Every day long, (laughing)

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:03.888
every day long, whatever
comes into the now,

00:04:03.888 --> 00:04:06.471
they look at it as an obstacle.

00:04:08.242 --> 00:04:12.021
(audience laughing)

00:04:12.021 --> 00:04:14.622
Get out of the way, I want to get there.

00:04:14.622 --> 00:04:17.205
Every person that comes in, no,

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.098
I want something else.

00:04:21.098 --> 00:04:22.741
The ego always wants not this,

00:04:22.741 --> 00:04:25.100
it wants to use this to get there.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.381
It wants to use every
person that comes into now,

00:04:27.381 --> 00:04:28.464
to get there.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.880
So every person the ego meets,

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:35.183
it say, "Okay, are you going to enable me

00:04:35.183 --> 00:04:38.281
"to get to the next more important moment?

00:04:38.281 --> 00:04:40.860
"How can I use you to get
where I want to get to?"

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.401
The now is made into an obstacle.

00:04:44.401 --> 00:04:47.379
Or, for the people who are very strongly,

00:04:47.379 --> 00:04:51.861
very strongly identified
with the egoic mind,

00:04:51.861 --> 00:04:54.528
they make the now into an enemy.

00:04:55.419 --> 00:04:58.055
Continuously complaining,
it's never enough.

00:04:58.055 --> 00:05:00.260
They should, why don't
they, this is never.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.159
Well, they could go into
the most wonderful place

00:05:02.159 --> 00:05:04.080
and after five minutes
they've found the one thing

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.360
that's not working as it should

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.921
and they're complaining.

00:05:07.921 --> 00:05:10.077
They should do something about it,

00:05:10.077 --> 00:05:12.683
if not I'm going to do something about it!

00:05:12.683 --> 00:05:15.600
(loudly breathing)

00:05:17.199 --> 00:05:18.860
And if they're not complaining verbally,

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.980
they're complaining in their heads.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.110
(quietly grumbling)

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:24.529
(audience laughing)

00:05:24.529 --> 00:05:26.264
They're complaining about situations,

00:05:26.264 --> 00:05:27.817
about other people,
about what's happening,

00:05:27.817 --> 00:05:29.924
or complaining that's something
that should be happening

00:05:29.924 --> 00:05:31.340
is not happening.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:34.283
(quietly grumbling)

00:05:34.283 --> 00:05:36.342
This is, it sounds insane,

00:05:36.342 --> 00:05:38.283
because it is insane,

00:05:38.283 --> 00:05:40.383
(audience laughing)

00:05:40.383 --> 00:05:42.103
but it is not recog, nothing personal.

00:05:42.103 --> 00:05:44.599
(audience laughing)

00:05:44.599 --> 00:05:47.304
It is not recognized as insanity

00:05:47.304 --> 00:05:49.554
because it is fairly normal

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:54.295
and if it's normal then
it's not recognized

00:05:54.295 --> 00:05:56.295
as an illness so that is

00:05:58.939 --> 00:06:01.418
the dysfunctional state of consciousness

00:06:01.418 --> 00:06:04.918
that is condemned to perpetual discontent.

00:06:07.024 --> 00:06:08.256
- How do I,

00:06:08.256 --> 00:06:10.499
you know, it seems you
try to stop thinking but

00:06:10.499 --> 00:06:11.981
and you read all this

00:06:11.981 --> 00:06:13.943
and you try to practice it,

00:06:13.943 --> 00:06:15.522
but yet at any given situation,

00:06:15.522 --> 00:06:17.515
I find that in order to

00:06:17.515 --> 00:06:20.944
get closer to practicing
it or even practice it,

00:06:20.944 --> 00:06:24.061
it's causing a lot of thoughts to happen.

00:06:24.061 --> 00:06:26.261
So, is that different kind of thoughts

00:06:26.261 --> 00:06:28.223
or are those thoughts that I should break

00:06:28.223 --> 00:06:30.677
that kind of habit and, if so how?

00:06:30.677 --> 00:06:33.094
- Okay, thank you, thank you.

00:06:38.481 --> 00:06:42.300
Now the, there's a lot
of talk these days about,

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:46.474
not just talk but actually
it's happening, addictions.

00:06:46.474 --> 00:06:49.203
Many people are addicted
to all kinds of things,

00:06:49.203 --> 00:06:50.120
substances,

00:06:51.223 --> 00:06:54.638
but one of the greatest addictions,

00:06:54.638 --> 00:06:57.724
or one of the greatest
addiction never actually,

00:06:57.724 --> 00:07:00.641
you've never read it in the papers,

00:07:01.701 --> 00:07:05.762
because the people who are
addicted to it don't know it.

00:07:05.762 --> 00:07:08.342
It's the addiction to thinking.

00:07:08.342 --> 00:07:10.199
It's actually addictive.

00:07:10.199 --> 00:07:11.300
Can't stop thinking,

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.904
It's like can't stop drinking,

00:07:12.904 --> 00:07:14.222
can't stop smoking,

00:07:14.222 --> 00:07:15.579
can't stop eating, can't stop thinking.

00:07:15.579 --> 00:07:20.300
Thinking is the greater
addiction than any of these

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.217
and it's an addiction because it's,

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.701
first it's been a drug,

00:07:27.701 --> 00:07:31.201
well it's just been around for so long and

00:07:32.325 --> 00:07:34.658
it's a subtle sense of self,

00:07:36.746 --> 00:07:38.308
so it's,

00:07:38.308 --> 00:07:41.100
a great reluctance on
the part of most people

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.933
to let go of thinking,

00:07:44.124 --> 00:07:47.503
which is equated with the state of sleep,

00:07:47.503 --> 00:07:49.424
to let go of thinking.

00:07:49.424 --> 00:07:52.041
There isn't that much to
understand in this teaching,

00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:53.645
there's a little bit to understand

00:07:53.645 --> 00:07:55.404
about how the ego works but even that

00:07:55.404 --> 00:07:58.405
is just mainly a self-observation.

00:07:58.405 --> 00:08:01.365
The main thing about it is

00:08:01.365 --> 00:08:02.948
presence, presence.

00:08:04.767 --> 00:08:07.934
And presence is a space of no thought,

00:08:11.064 --> 00:08:13.863
but presence can also be
there in the background,

00:08:13.863 --> 00:08:15.988
even when thinking is happening.

00:08:15.988 --> 00:08:19.723
You can still be not completely
involved in the thinking.

00:08:19.723 --> 00:08:22.704
Thinking loses the ability to create

00:08:22.704 --> 00:08:25.787
havoc in your life and confuse you so

00:08:30.509 --> 00:08:34.445
your choice then is
not to understand more,

00:08:34.445 --> 00:08:37.429
or to bring some intellectual analysis

00:08:37.429 --> 00:08:38.762
to the practice,

00:08:39.903 --> 00:08:41.153
but to practice

00:08:42.845 --> 00:08:45.608
the state of not thinking which can be

00:08:45.608 --> 00:08:50.409
arrived at by various
ways as you probably know,

00:08:50.409 --> 00:08:53.125
if you don't think about it, just do it.

00:08:53.125 --> 00:08:56.125
(audience laughing)

00:08:57.431 --> 00:08:59.510
Becoming more aware of the present moment

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.427
and accept it as it is,

00:09:02.366 --> 00:09:06.033
slows down the overactive
mind is one thing.

00:09:07.689 --> 00:09:10.092
Because a lot of the
overactivity of the mind is

00:09:10.092 --> 00:09:12.791
an attempt to get away from the isness,

00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:15.874
the simplicity of the present moment.

00:09:15.874 --> 00:09:18.124
So, to become more aware of

00:09:19.229 --> 00:09:22.393
the present moment as a practice,

00:09:22.393 --> 00:09:24.829
have perhaps a little
pointers in your office,

00:09:24.829 --> 00:09:26.253
at home, in your car,

00:09:26.253 --> 00:09:29.253
that say present moment or whatever,

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.243
or a symbol for it and

00:09:33.213 --> 00:09:36.428
and some different entry points

00:09:36.428 --> 00:09:38.428
into the present moment.

00:09:39.709 --> 00:09:41.491
Present moment awareness means

00:09:41.491 --> 00:09:45.148
thinking subsides, may
not disappear completely,

00:09:45.148 --> 00:09:48.648
but something else arises that is primary.

00:09:50.129 --> 00:09:53.130
We call it presence or awareness,

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:56.186
Buddhist's call it mindfulness,

00:09:56.186 --> 00:09:58.303
which I don't use because it implies,

00:09:58.303 --> 00:10:00.189
your mind is full of things,

00:10:00.189 --> 00:10:02.370
but it isn't of course.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.649
(audience laughing)

00:10:03.649 --> 00:10:05.849
It's just a mistranslation, so.

00:10:05.849 --> 00:10:07.411
(audience laughing)

00:10:07.411 --> 00:10:08.578
To be present,

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.751
first of all, use the
present moment to become,

00:10:12.751 --> 00:10:16.190
but how do you become conscious
of the present moment?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.109
Now when you get it,

00:10:18.109 --> 00:10:19.531
after awhile you can,

00:10:19.531 --> 00:10:22.190
you can actually sense the
presence of the present,

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.390
sort of speak, directly

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.933
and there it is, choo.

00:10:26.933 --> 00:10:29.412
But, helpful things are,

00:10:29.412 --> 00:10:30.912
sense perceptions,

00:10:32.308 --> 00:10:34.224
take you out of thinking if you're

00:10:34.224 --> 00:10:36.348
not judging the sense perceptions,

00:10:36.348 --> 00:10:39.098
labeling, naming, looking around.

00:10:40.714 --> 00:10:42.473
Anywhere, wherever you are,

00:10:42.473 --> 00:10:43.473
look around,

00:10:46.628 --> 00:10:50.835
practice sense perceptions
without this compulsive

00:10:50.835 --> 00:10:54.668
interference of naming
what you're perceiving.

00:10:56.274 --> 00:10:57.975
Oh, that's a beautiful flower,

00:10:57.975 --> 00:10:59.136
I wonder what it's called?

00:10:59.136 --> 00:11:00.134
I don't know what it's called,

00:11:00.134 --> 00:11:02.073
to all that helps I can
be free of thinking.

00:11:02.073 --> 00:11:04.368
If I know what it's called,

00:11:04.368 --> 00:11:06.375
I can say, oh, that's such and such

00:11:06.375 --> 00:11:07.958
and then drop that.

00:11:11.428 --> 00:11:14.446
See what it means to perceive without

00:11:14.446 --> 00:11:17.113
interference of concepts, words.

00:11:18.788 --> 00:11:21.038
In this moment for example,

00:11:21.948 --> 00:11:24.286
you're looking at me,

00:11:24.286 --> 00:11:25.536
now, let's say,

00:11:27.107 --> 00:11:28.024
between now

00:11:30.468 --> 00:11:31.301
and now,

00:11:32.204 --> 00:11:33.704
were you thinking?

00:11:35.252 --> 00:11:36.871
No.

00:11:36.871 --> 00:11:37.844
Okay.

00:11:37.844 --> 00:11:40.364
And again, between now

00:11:40.364 --> 00:11:41.197
and

00:11:44.568 --> 00:11:47.904
now, were you thinking or present?

00:11:47.904 --> 00:11:48.737
- Present.

00:11:49.967 --> 00:11:51.343
- [Eckhart] No thought?

00:11:51.343 --> 00:11:54.524
And while I speak, do you
need to think to understand

00:11:54.524 --> 00:11:56.469
what I'm saying or can you just listen

00:11:56.469 --> 00:11:58.344
and understand it?

00:11:58.344 --> 00:12:00.224
- Just listen.

00:12:00.224 --> 00:12:02.529
- And this is what you're doing?

00:12:02.529 --> 00:12:05.188
And so, that's part of the teaching

00:12:05.188 --> 00:12:08.067
and the function of the spiritual teacher,

00:12:08.067 --> 00:12:10.984
imparting information is secondary.

00:12:12.188 --> 00:12:15.355
What I'm telling you now is secondary.

00:12:16.966 --> 00:12:21.384
What is primary is the
underlying state of consciousness

00:12:21.384 --> 00:12:24.007
which is presence, that's the teaching.

00:12:24.007 --> 00:12:25.528
But you can't talk about that.

00:12:25.528 --> 00:12:27.067
It's underlying.

00:12:27.067 --> 00:12:29.644
But the, a sign that it's working is

00:12:29.644 --> 00:12:31.484
that while you listen,

00:12:31.484 --> 00:12:35.863
there's no thought, there's
just a alert presence.

00:12:35.863 --> 00:12:40.030
And when the so called teacher
stops speaking for a moment,

00:12:41.041 --> 00:12:42.804
the alert presence remains,

00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:45.475
it does not need to be
filled with anything.

00:12:45.475 --> 00:12:48.001
(quietly whistling)

00:12:48.001 --> 00:12:48.834
Like now.

00:12:52.809 --> 00:12:54.126
What is there to think about?

00:12:54.126 --> 00:12:55.131
Nothing.

00:12:55.131 --> 00:12:57.429
Now, if we do this for longer, if I,

00:12:57.429 --> 00:12:58.596
at some point,

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.787
your mind will probably
start up and think,

00:13:02.787 --> 00:13:05.206
well, how much longer is
he going to sit there.

00:13:05.206 --> 00:13:07.983
(audience laughing)

00:13:07.983 --> 00:13:10.566
And when that happens,

00:13:10.566 --> 00:13:13.207
you can allow your mind
to say how much longer

00:13:13.207 --> 00:13:15.228
is he going to sit there and say nothing

00:13:15.228 --> 00:13:18.670
and then come back to a presence.

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:21.491
And then some other thought will come.

00:13:21.491 --> 00:13:23.430
What's this all about?

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.549
And then you can allow that thought arise

00:13:25.549 --> 00:13:27.625
and then be present again,

00:13:27.625 --> 00:13:29.545
which means you're not really,

00:13:29.545 --> 00:13:32.886
your priority is no longer
to follow the thought

00:13:32.886 --> 00:13:35.742
where it wants to take you,

00:13:35.742 --> 00:13:37.443
because the thought

00:13:37.443 --> 00:13:38.804
has a magnetic pull,

00:13:38.804 --> 00:13:40.746
it wants more of your consciousness

00:13:40.746 --> 00:13:42.647
but it wants to grow,

00:13:42.647 --> 00:13:44.386
because it's a little entity.

00:13:44.386 --> 00:13:45.408
It wants to grow,

00:13:45.408 --> 00:13:47.451
so it wants your attention

00:13:47.451 --> 00:13:50.551
and in subtle ways he tries
to get your attention.

00:13:50.551 --> 00:13:53.929
It says, it might even
use a bodily feeling,

00:13:53.929 --> 00:13:57.291
it says, "God, I'm hungry suddenly,

00:13:57.291 --> 00:13:59.945
"why didn't I need to eat something?"

00:13:59.945 --> 00:14:01.511
And then you think of a,

00:14:01.511 --> 00:14:03.966
what restaurant am I going to afterwards?

00:14:03.966 --> 00:14:05.766
And so the presence is gone,

00:14:05.766 --> 00:14:07.008
you are gone,

00:14:07.008 --> 00:14:09.688
you are looking for a
restaurant in your mind.

00:14:09.688 --> 00:14:13.045
(audience laughing)

00:14:13.045 --> 00:14:15.251
Which means the thought used as

00:14:15.251 --> 00:14:18.349
some bodily thing to
make thoughts out of it

00:14:18.349 --> 00:14:20.510
completely pointless
because you can't find

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:22.585
a restaurant because you're standing here.

00:14:22.585 --> 00:14:24.290
(audience laughing)

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:27.209
But it can use all kinds of
things to manufacture most,

00:14:27.209 --> 00:14:28.730
to get your attention

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:29.986
and if you're not careful,

00:14:29.986 --> 00:14:32.068
if you don't know the mechanism,

00:14:32.068 --> 00:14:34.228
it's not so much an
intellectual understanding

00:14:34.228 --> 00:14:37.606
but a simple realization
that this what the mind does.

00:14:37.606 --> 00:14:39.371
It tries to pull you in.

00:14:39.371 --> 00:14:41.029
It's fine, that's what it does.

00:14:41.029 --> 00:14:42.807
Once you know that,

00:14:42.807 --> 00:14:44.806
you can allow thought to arise

00:14:44.806 --> 00:14:46.869
without following it,

00:14:46.869 --> 00:14:48.688
where it wants you to go,

00:14:48.688 --> 00:14:51.811
which is into another bigger
thought and a bigger one.

00:14:51.811 --> 00:14:53.007
So then you become like,

00:14:53.007 --> 00:14:56.387
like my dog when it finds a scent

00:14:56.387 --> 00:14:59.054
and when suddenly, even the dog,

00:15:02.068 --> 00:15:03.607
when the dog is off leash,

00:15:03.607 --> 00:15:05.511
usually she's fine, she
just runs around you,

00:15:05.511 --> 00:15:08.766
but suddenly she picks up a scent

00:15:08.766 --> 00:15:12.047
and then she goes off completely
unaware of surroundings

00:15:12.047 --> 00:15:14.119
or anything, you just follow the scent.

00:15:14.119 --> 00:15:15.260
(sniffing loudly)

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.135
(audience laughing)

00:15:17.135 --> 00:15:18.647
Then she could get lost,

00:15:18.647 --> 00:15:20.290
she goes off to the horizon sometimes.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.289
(audience laughing)

00:15:21.289 --> 00:15:22.305
Just disappears.

00:15:22.305 --> 00:15:25.702
And that's, when you follow a thought,

00:15:25.702 --> 00:15:27.407
it goes like that,

00:15:27.407 --> 00:15:29.323
you can wake up 20 minutes later,

00:15:29.323 --> 00:15:30.931
(audience laughing)

00:15:30.931 --> 00:15:33.702
when it started with I was
feeling a little bit hungry

00:15:33.702 --> 00:15:36.264
and thinking of a
restaurant and it ends up

00:15:36.264 --> 00:15:39.371
with thinking about how
dreadful your life is.

00:15:39.371 --> 00:15:42.371
(audience laughing)

00:15:43.568 --> 00:15:45.735
"I find myself fluctuating

00:15:47.269 --> 00:15:49.707
"between the path of spirituality

00:15:49.707 --> 00:15:52.540
"and wanting more material wealth.

00:15:53.428 --> 00:15:56.428
"Are these paths mutually exclusive?

00:15:57.536 --> 00:16:00.453
Your feedback is much appreciated."

00:16:03.865 --> 00:16:07.875
Fluctuating between the
path of spirituality

00:16:07.875 --> 00:16:10.625
and wanting more material wealth.

00:16:11.568 --> 00:16:14.485
Are these paths mutually exclusive?

00:16:26.168 --> 00:16:29.835
If material wealth
becomes your primary aim,

00:16:32.188 --> 00:16:36.105
then one could say they
are mutually exclusive.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.827
But if you engage in some activity,

00:16:48.324 --> 00:16:51.741
that you truly, first of all truly enjoy,

00:16:56.046 --> 00:16:57.296
enjoy the doing

00:16:58.966 --> 00:17:01.716
and secondly, you've let activity

00:17:04.309 --> 00:17:08.044
that you engage in and enjoy doing,

00:17:08.044 --> 00:17:10.044
makes some contribution,

00:17:11.465 --> 00:17:14.882
some positive contribution to this world,

00:17:17.667 --> 00:17:20.362
to the planet, to other human beings,

00:17:20.362 --> 00:17:21.445
add something

00:17:22.522 --> 00:17:23.355
valuable,

00:17:25.771 --> 00:17:26.604
to life,

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:34.047
increases, perhaps
consciousness on the planet,

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:41.800
then if those two things come together,

00:17:43.368 --> 00:17:45.201
then you may find that

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:49.520
as a by-product of that activity,

00:17:50.671 --> 00:17:53.838
some material wealth also comes to you

00:17:57.866 --> 00:18:02.104
and there's no reason why you cannot enjoy

00:18:02.104 --> 00:18:06.504
certain forms, material
form, whatever it is

00:18:06.504 --> 00:18:08.541
that come to you

00:18:08.541 --> 00:18:10.124
and you enjoy that.

00:18:12.444 --> 00:18:14.027
You may,

00:18:14.027 --> 00:18:16.448
should give away some of that

00:18:16.448 --> 00:18:18.805
and that's enjoyable too

00:18:18.805 --> 00:18:21.465
and you mean, if beautiful things come

00:18:21.465 --> 00:18:23.298
or bigger things come,

00:18:24.848 --> 00:18:27.646
the enjoyment of a beautiful thing

00:18:27.646 --> 00:18:29.646
or a house or even a car

00:18:30.525 --> 00:18:33.275
is not necessarily non-spiritual.

00:18:35.225 --> 00:18:36.475
The attachment

00:18:38.507 --> 00:18:41.757
or the excessive preoccupation with it,

00:18:43.725 --> 00:18:45.467
with the attainment of it,

00:18:45.467 --> 00:18:47.028
that is not compatible,

00:18:47.028 --> 00:18:49.246
that it takes you away from

00:18:49.246 --> 00:18:53.329
reality, the truth of who
you are from awakening,

00:18:56.485 --> 00:18:59.902
but you can be quite present and in touch

00:19:01.343 --> 00:19:04.120
with that which is beyond
form and nevertheless

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.537
enjoy forms that come to you.

00:19:07.801 --> 00:19:09.244
And not in an obsessive way

00:19:09.244 --> 00:19:11.984
or if you're wanting to
accumulate as much as possible

00:19:11.984 --> 00:19:15.067
of this or that but enjoy what comes,

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:21.066
without identification
with the forms that come,

00:19:21.066 --> 00:19:25.233
the house, the car, whatever
the material thing may be.

00:19:27.523 --> 00:19:31.106
So in that sense they
are not incompatible.

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:38.229
Renunciation, which
traditionally is recommended

00:19:38.229 --> 00:19:40.146
as a path to awakening,

00:19:42.951 --> 00:19:45.389
is not, the true renunciation is

00:19:45.389 --> 00:19:49.150
not really renouncing material things,

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:53.317
it's renouncing attachment
or identification with,

00:19:56.128 --> 00:19:58.183
because many people traditionally,

00:19:58.183 --> 00:20:01.124
in many cultures and religions,

00:20:01.124 --> 00:20:04.551
who have renounced material things,

00:20:04.551 --> 00:20:05.718
didn't realize

00:20:07.246 --> 00:20:11.329
that they had not renounced
desire in their mind.

00:20:14.145 --> 00:20:16.745
So they suppress, they
just try to suppress desire

00:20:16.745 --> 00:20:19.866
and by having no possessions

00:20:19.866 --> 00:20:23.033
and refraining another part of course,

00:20:24.007 --> 00:20:26.666
renunciation would be,

00:20:26.666 --> 00:20:29.907
celibacy for example,
refraining from sexual activity

00:20:29.907 --> 00:20:32.688
as part of renunciation,

00:20:32.688 --> 00:20:35.438
without realizing that they have,

00:20:37.448 --> 00:20:42.024
they spend large part of
the day thinking about sex.

00:20:42.024 --> 00:20:43.607
(laughing)

00:20:43.607 --> 00:20:45.970
So yeah, that alter renunciation,

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.387
is not really the main thing,

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:53.800
the true renunciation is attachment to,

00:20:55.571 --> 00:20:58.321
which operates on an inner level.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.623
So you can have a very poor person

00:21:06.282 --> 00:21:10.497
being attached to their few
possessions very strongly

00:21:10.497 --> 00:21:12.998
and seeking identification through that.

00:21:12.998 --> 00:21:14.821
You could have a very wealth person,

00:21:14.821 --> 00:21:17.404
not being attached to anything.

00:21:20.055 --> 00:21:24.222
Of course, the other way
around can also be the case.

00:21:30.052 --> 00:21:32.969
So, it's the inner that matters and

00:21:38.851 --> 00:21:41.351
whether or not you're attached

00:21:42.658 --> 00:21:44.575
to some material thing,

00:21:46.234 --> 00:21:49.361
you can usually, often,
you can may not be able

00:21:49.361 --> 00:21:53.184
to really tell it until you lose it,

00:21:53.184 --> 00:21:54.184
or it breaks

00:21:56.536 --> 00:21:58.562
and so it's always a good little test

00:21:58.562 --> 00:22:00.141
when something leaves you

00:22:00.141 --> 00:22:03.141
or is stolen or breaks or destroyed.

00:22:05.518 --> 00:22:07.351
If then, upset arises,

00:22:09.858 --> 00:22:12.108
anger or whatever, then oh,

00:22:13.457 --> 00:22:17.978
I was attached, I thought
I was not. (laughing)

00:22:17.978 --> 00:22:20.719
But when you can let
go of when things come

00:22:20.719 --> 00:22:22.258
and then things go.

00:22:22.258 --> 00:22:24.717
Perhaps things come to
you and perhaps often,

00:22:24.717 --> 00:22:27.738
well you give it to
somebody else to enjoy.

00:22:27.738 --> 00:22:31.571
That's appreciating
beautiful things that you,

00:22:33.757 --> 00:22:37.590
a sense of ownership
also begins to disappear,

00:22:38.697 --> 00:22:42.614
so you look after something
for awhile and then

00:22:44.398 --> 00:22:46.550
it's handed on to somebody else.

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.821
There are a quite a few people

00:22:48.821 --> 00:22:51.939
who do not express emotions fully,

00:22:51.939 --> 00:22:54.356
or don't express them at all.

00:22:58.115 --> 00:23:01.513
Perhaps in mostly in Northern countries.

00:23:01.513 --> 00:23:02.835
The further north you go,

00:23:02.835 --> 00:23:04.559
the less they express their emotions,

00:23:04.559 --> 00:23:06.939
that's how it seems to be. (laughing)

00:23:06.939 --> 00:23:08.680
Maybe it's too cold to
express their emotions.

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:11.680
(everyone laughing)

00:23:15.977 --> 00:23:19.919
Now the practice I describe
of observing your emotions,

00:23:19.919 --> 00:23:21.586
allowing them to be,

00:23:23.942 --> 00:23:28.109
well somebody who habitually
does not express emotions,

00:23:29.135 --> 00:23:33.218
it is not usually the best
way to try and observe

00:23:37.018 --> 00:23:40.161
his or her emotions because
they may not even know

00:23:40.161 --> 00:23:42.639
what the emotions they are having.

00:23:42.639 --> 00:23:45.306
They may be so much pushed down,

00:23:47.341 --> 00:23:49.280
so particularly for those people

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:52.197
who have been suppressing emotions,

00:23:53.636 --> 00:23:57.819
it is very helpful to express the emotions

00:23:57.819 --> 00:24:01.902
if possible without injuring
anybody or yourself.

00:24:03.537 --> 00:24:06.954
To allow yourself to express emotions and

00:24:08.001 --> 00:24:10.501
witness that at the same time.

00:24:12.982 --> 00:24:16.622
So the expression itself
would not free you,

00:24:16.622 --> 00:24:20.122
because emotions, if they are not observed

00:24:21.136 --> 00:24:23.901
and not witnessed tend to renew themselves

00:24:23.901 --> 00:24:26.978
through renewed thinking because there's

00:24:26.978 --> 00:24:29.381
this vicious circle of
emotion and thought processes.

00:24:29.381 --> 00:24:32.197
So the expression alone,

00:24:32.197 --> 00:24:35.616
is not enough because you would simply

00:24:35.616 --> 00:24:38.866
be stuck with it and express the anger,

00:24:39.979 --> 00:24:44.755
because the anger dissipates
somewhat as you express it,

00:24:44.755 --> 00:24:46.899
but if you're not conscious
of the relationship

00:24:46.899 --> 00:24:49.902
between your thought
processes and the anger,

00:24:49.902 --> 00:24:53.613
the thought processes
will create renewed anger.

00:24:53.613 --> 00:24:56.421
And so you would be going to the same

00:24:56.421 --> 00:24:58.996
or other therapists
and hitting the pillows

00:24:58.996 --> 00:25:01.680
for 20 or 30 years, not realizing that,

00:25:01.680 --> 00:25:03.898
through your thought processes,

00:25:03.898 --> 00:25:06.539
you're continuously recreating emotion

00:25:06.539 --> 00:25:08.577
and you're identifying so much,

00:25:08.577 --> 00:25:10.542
so without the presence,

00:25:10.542 --> 00:25:13.582
expression is better than repression.

00:25:13.582 --> 00:25:15.915
Repression can make you ill.

00:25:19.043 --> 00:25:21.376
But to become, to transcend,

00:25:22.242 --> 00:25:26.265
it is essential to be
alert and present and

00:25:26.265 --> 00:25:28.598
watch it as an energy field,

00:25:31.501 --> 00:25:34.982
so that through the watching
it becomes depersonalized

00:25:34.982 --> 00:25:36.261
so that you don't feel,

00:25:36.261 --> 00:25:37.341
(quick inhaling)

00:25:37.341 --> 00:25:38.761
you're not totally stuck in it

00:25:38.761 --> 00:25:41.197
and then you can express it,

00:25:41.197 --> 00:25:44.272
hit something, not a person if possible,

00:25:44.272 --> 00:25:46.272
the pillow if its anger,

00:25:47.717 --> 00:25:50.634
or scream and it feels good perhaps

00:25:53.415 --> 00:25:56.782
and feel the raw energy of it like fire.

00:25:56.782 --> 00:25:59.181
(loudly groaning)

00:25:59.181 --> 00:26:00.845
And feel it, wow!

00:26:00.845 --> 00:26:04.682
And if you allow it
completely and express it,

00:26:04.682 --> 00:26:07.682
it can even very quickly turn around

00:26:08.583 --> 00:26:10.383
and then you can do something useful,

00:26:10.383 --> 00:26:13.384
that you have enormous energy

00:26:13.384 --> 00:26:14.481
and suddenly it gets turned around

00:26:14.481 --> 00:26:16.002
and it's just,

00:26:16.002 --> 00:26:18.504
it's no longer, it can shift from anger

00:26:18.504 --> 00:26:21.081
to just being intense energy.

00:26:21.081 --> 00:26:23.442
Okay, now I'm going to clean my room.

00:26:23.442 --> 00:26:25.342
(audience laughing)

00:26:25.342 --> 00:26:28.509
Not angry anymore, simply with energy.

00:26:29.559 --> 00:26:32.204
You could also clean your
room still being angry

00:26:32.204 --> 00:26:33.823
but that's not good cleaning,

00:26:33.823 --> 00:26:36.821
because you would be cleaning
on the material level

00:26:36.821 --> 00:26:39.063
and on an energetic level,

00:26:39.063 --> 00:26:40.904
you would be polluting your room.

00:26:40.904 --> 00:26:43.904
(everyone laughing)

00:26:47.767 --> 00:26:49.684
And so, to become free,

00:26:52.022 --> 00:26:56.120
for awhile some people
need to express fully

00:26:56.120 --> 00:26:57.362
and then a time comes when,

00:26:57.362 --> 00:27:01.705
there's enough presence
and you have expressed it,

00:27:01.705 --> 00:27:05.426
then you can gradually more and more,

00:27:05.426 --> 00:27:09.065
work on the inner level
and bring presence to it

00:27:09.065 --> 00:27:12.804
on the inner, not that
you ever hold it down.

00:27:12.804 --> 00:27:15.642
If it wants to and
needs to express itself,

00:27:15.642 --> 00:27:17.163
you may do something.

00:27:17.163 --> 00:27:21.825
Maybe you can transform
it into physical movement,

00:27:21.825 --> 00:27:25.424
vigorous movement or whatever it is,

00:27:25.424 --> 00:27:29.257
and watch, but always
be there as the witness.

00:27:30.782 --> 00:27:33.319
At some point, you may,

00:27:33.319 --> 00:27:36.024
you have find that you have a choice.

00:27:36.024 --> 00:27:37.864
The emotion arises,

00:27:37.864 --> 00:27:41.004
you can express it or not express it

00:27:41.004 --> 00:27:42.754
and it can simply be,

00:27:44.040 --> 00:27:48.801
transformed or transmuted
through bringing presence to it.

00:27:48.801 --> 00:27:50.403
You will know in the moment

00:27:50.403 --> 00:27:53.526
whether it needs to express itself or not.

00:27:53.526 --> 00:27:58.074
If you have never or
rarely expressed emotion,

00:27:58.074 --> 00:27:58.907
then,

00:28:00.941 --> 00:28:04.657
by all means allow yourself to express it

00:28:04.657 --> 00:28:09.376
without indulging and
without personalizing it.

00:28:09.376 --> 00:28:12.126
Recognizing it as energy no more,

00:28:13.376 --> 00:28:15.626
just it's energy and watch.

00:28:16.938 --> 00:28:18.834
What happens when you pay attention

00:28:18.834 --> 00:28:22.334
to the way in which interact with objects.

00:28:25.398 --> 00:28:26.901
And what is, okay,

00:28:26.901 --> 00:28:29.740
every minute of the day this,

00:28:29.740 --> 00:28:32.358
you pick something up,
you put something down.

00:28:32.358 --> 00:28:34.653
You unbutton your shirt,

00:28:34.653 --> 00:28:37.393
you take off your shoes,

00:28:37.393 --> 00:28:39.893
you lift this, put this there,

00:28:40.936 --> 00:28:44.717
open your zipper, bag.
(imitating zipper opening)

00:28:44.717 --> 00:28:46.056
(audience laughing)

00:28:46.056 --> 00:28:47.054
(air whooshing)

00:28:47.054 --> 00:28:48.058
You look inside,

00:28:48.058 --> 00:28:50.975
take something out, can you feel it

00:28:52.778 --> 00:28:53.997
as you take it out,

00:28:53.997 --> 00:28:55.711
can you feel the texture that

00:28:55.711 --> 00:28:57.497
and then you put it on the table.

00:28:57.497 --> 00:29:00.034
It makes a sound as
you put it on the table

00:29:00.034 --> 00:29:03.134
and then you have a glass of water

00:29:03.134 --> 00:29:05.234
and the light is reflected in it

00:29:05.234 --> 00:29:06.317
and it moves.

00:29:08.074 --> 00:29:13.037
Perhaps you drink and it tastes
and you put it down again

00:29:13.037 --> 00:29:15.655
and then you look at a familiar object

00:29:15.655 --> 00:29:17.515
and instead of using it,

00:29:17.515 --> 00:29:20.479
always as a means to an end.

00:29:20.479 --> 00:29:23.812
Here you have the luxury of occasionally

00:29:24.839 --> 00:29:28.635
just taking an ordinary object
that you handle every day

00:29:28.635 --> 00:29:30.497
and just for a few seconds give it,

00:29:30.497 --> 00:29:33.378
give it attention and
acknowledge its being

00:29:33.378 --> 00:29:36.478
just as that, as that object,

00:29:36.478 --> 00:29:38.228
just feel it, see it,

00:29:40.216 --> 00:29:43.883
perhaps it makes a noise
as you put it down.

00:29:45.032 --> 00:29:48.449
And again you bring in sense perceptions,

00:29:49.808 --> 00:29:52.391
getting dressed in the morning,

00:29:53.500 --> 00:29:55.444
putting your pants on, they make a noise

00:29:55.444 --> 00:29:58.111
as you put them on a little bit.

00:30:00.590 --> 00:30:01.423
Do things,

00:30:02.407 --> 00:30:05.490
you pick up the toothpaste,

00:30:05.490 --> 00:30:08.073
you hold it for a moment, open,

00:30:08.990 --> 00:30:11.490
put the cap on the sink, click

00:30:13.723 --> 00:30:17.330
and then turn on the tap
(imitating water swooshing)

00:30:17.330 --> 00:30:19.027
and then while you brush your teeth

00:30:19.027 --> 00:30:20.606
you turn off the tap,

00:30:20.606 --> 00:30:22.748
because you don't waste water

00:30:22.748 --> 00:30:23.752
(audience laughing)

00:30:23.752 --> 00:30:27.392
but that's not part of the
exercise, that's a natural thing.

00:30:27.392 --> 00:30:30.392
(audience laughing)

00:30:31.490 --> 00:30:35.073
You can actually begin
to like and to enjoy

00:30:36.790 --> 00:30:39.207
the tiniest things around you

00:30:40.830 --> 00:30:44.580
that would normally be
completely overlooked.

00:30:45.469 --> 00:30:48.136
So the way in which you interact

00:30:49.430 --> 00:30:51.347
with a world of objects

00:30:53.012 --> 00:30:56.814
and that brings a richness into your life

00:30:56.814 --> 00:31:00.013
that doesn't depend on
how many objects you own.

00:31:00.013 --> 00:31:03.167
You don't need to own
them to interact with them

00:31:03.167 --> 00:31:05.500
and so, here you acknowledge

00:31:08.868 --> 00:31:11.147
their beingness and
you sometimes you might

00:31:11.147 --> 00:31:13.933
just put your hand as I'm doing now,

00:31:13.933 --> 00:31:16.470
here's a table, it's wood

00:31:16.470 --> 00:31:18.014
and I'm putting my hand on it

00:31:18.014 --> 00:31:22.910
and for a moment I feel
the smooth texture, surface

00:31:22.910 --> 00:31:24.660
of this table and it,

00:31:26.971 --> 00:31:29.110
it feels very pleasant.

00:31:29.110 --> 00:31:32.411
But I don't need the mind to tell me that,

00:31:32.411 --> 00:31:33.744
I can sense that

00:31:35.470 --> 00:31:37.553
and the strange thing is,

00:31:38.910 --> 00:31:41.660
even so called inanimate objects,

00:31:43.510 --> 00:31:47.010
in a strange way have a life of their own.

00:31:49.508 --> 00:31:52.171
"As I'm awakening, I'm becoming more aware

00:31:52.171 --> 00:31:54.075
"of how often I'm angry

00:31:54.075 --> 00:31:56.374
"and it is getting tiresome.

00:31:56.374 --> 00:31:59.374
(everyone laughing)

00:32:02.335 --> 00:32:06.085
"How do I manage the
expectations of myself?"

00:32:07.734 --> 00:32:10.817
Well, let's see, so man that you need

00:32:13.214 --> 00:32:14.305
to manage the expectations

00:32:14.305 --> 00:32:16.134
and then you need to manage the anger,

00:32:16.134 --> 00:32:18.932
anger management and
expectation management.

00:32:18.932 --> 00:32:22.635
Expectation means you beat yourself

00:32:22.635 --> 00:32:26.054
up for being unconscious, (laughing)

00:32:26.054 --> 00:32:28.835
which is more unconsciousness.

00:32:28.835 --> 00:32:29.969
(audience laughing)

00:32:29.969 --> 00:32:33.527
Because the mental
image of who you access,

00:32:33.527 --> 00:32:36.852
I'm not good enough, I
can't do it, you see?

00:32:36.852 --> 00:32:39.551
But been at it for 25 years
and I still can't do it.

00:32:39.551 --> 00:32:41.773
You can't possibly be any good

00:32:41.773 --> 00:32:45.873
if you still can't do it after 25 years.

00:32:45.873 --> 00:32:49.886
Those are thoughts that
float around in your mind

00:32:49.886 --> 00:32:51.553
and how do you feel,

00:32:53.471 --> 00:32:55.929
well I suppose that's
bar, Katie would ask that,

00:32:55.929 --> 00:32:59.491
how do you feel when you
believe in your thoughts?

00:32:59.491 --> 00:33:00.971
(laughing)

00:33:00.971 --> 00:33:01.804
Not good.

00:33:02.910 --> 00:33:04.211
You're beating yourself up

00:33:04.211 --> 00:33:06.271
and you feel an emotion.

00:33:06.271 --> 00:33:09.354
Feel bad about myself, more ego, more

00:33:17.838 --> 00:33:21.297
conceptualized identity in your mind.

00:33:21.297 --> 00:33:24.192
Concept in your mind about you,

00:33:24.192 --> 00:33:27.232
you derive your sense of self from that,

00:33:27.232 --> 00:33:29.032
more of the same.

00:33:29.032 --> 00:33:31.365
So the, let's say it's anger

00:33:32.379 --> 00:33:35.055
and then you wake up
after the anger reactions,

00:33:35.055 --> 00:33:37.697
(sharply inhaling) I did it again,

00:33:37.697 --> 00:33:39.316
I'm no good.

00:33:39.316 --> 00:33:44.096
So you have the second egoic
reaction to the first one.

00:33:44.096 --> 00:33:46.346
(laughing)

00:33:52.134 --> 00:33:54.835
Anger is something that is

00:33:54.835 --> 00:33:57.418
comes in many people very fast,

00:34:00.156 --> 00:34:03.476
so there may not be,
unless there's already

00:34:03.476 --> 00:34:06.298
considerable presence power in you,

00:34:06.298 --> 00:34:08.614
there may not be enough
presence to catch it.

00:34:08.614 --> 00:34:10.559
It takes you all over before you know it,

00:34:10.559 --> 00:34:12.718
especially old reaction

00:34:12.718 --> 00:34:14.850
(sharply inhaling)

00:34:14.850 --> 00:34:15.847
and before you know it,

00:34:15.847 --> 00:34:18.032
you're talking and shouting
and you are not doing at all.

00:34:18.032 --> 00:34:20.450
It's the pattern, it's the,

00:34:20.450 --> 00:34:24.734
the mind pattern, mental
emotional pattern in you,

00:34:24.734 --> 00:34:28.757
which often related to
what I call the Pain-Body,

00:34:28.757 --> 00:34:32.174
which is old accumulated painful emotion,

00:34:33.796 --> 00:34:35.758
which could be anger,

00:34:35.758 --> 00:34:39.091
which could be a deep depressed sadness.

00:34:41.099 --> 00:34:42.612
Anger is a very frequent one,

00:34:42.612 --> 00:34:45.754
as the pain-body energy is just waiting

00:34:45.754 --> 00:34:49.115
in people who have accumulated old anger

00:34:49.115 --> 00:34:51.135
going back to childhood,

00:34:51.135 --> 00:34:54.635
feeling powerless and what does a child do

00:34:55.994 --> 00:34:57.858
when the child feels powerless?

00:34:57.858 --> 00:34:59.651
It starts screaming, it's all he can do

00:34:59.651 --> 00:35:00.940
and sometimes it works,

00:35:00.940 --> 00:35:02.594
sometimes the parents come and say, okay,

00:35:02.594 --> 00:35:05.514
you can have the sweet,
if you scream loud enough.

00:35:05.514 --> 00:35:09.514
So its powerlessness
is always behind anger

00:35:09.514 --> 00:35:14.175
and the ego pretends that there's
your power there in anger,

00:35:14.175 --> 00:35:18.698
but anger rises out of
sense of powerlessness

00:35:18.698 --> 00:35:22.477
and it's a, so they,
and there's often fear

00:35:22.477 --> 00:35:24.294
hiding underneath it

00:35:24.294 --> 00:35:27.496
and when you, when you
are there looking at it,

00:35:27.496 --> 00:35:30.917
then you can, you realize
that at first hand

00:35:30.917 --> 00:35:35.578
within yourself, there's
a sense of powerlessness

00:35:35.578 --> 00:35:38.856
behind it and the ego's
pretending to be powerful

00:35:38.856 --> 00:35:40.977
when really it's in a state of fear.

00:35:40.977 --> 00:35:43.218
You can see these with little dogs.

00:35:43.218 --> 00:35:45.315
The smallest dogs are the most,

00:35:45.315 --> 00:35:46.817
they bark the most.

00:35:46.817 --> 00:35:47.897
(audience laughing)

00:35:47.897 --> 00:35:49.754
Whenever their, their little,

00:35:49.754 --> 00:35:52.918
I've seen little, little dogs
whenever a big one goes past,

00:35:52.918 --> 00:35:55.515
they get angry, (imitating dog yapping)

00:35:55.515 --> 00:35:59.176
(everyone laughing)

00:35:59.176 --> 00:36:02.229
because, I mean if I were that size,

00:36:02.229 --> 00:36:03.715
I would do that too probably.

00:36:03.715 --> 00:36:07.212
(audience laughing)

00:36:07.212 --> 00:36:09.652
So you are, you are a little,

00:36:09.652 --> 00:36:13.569
Chihuahua or you're a
little sweet Bichon Frise

00:36:15.418 --> 00:36:18.835
and a Mastiff walks past or a Rottweiler,

00:36:20.354 --> 00:36:22.779
who looks very quiet
because the Rottweiler

00:36:22.779 --> 00:36:24.446
knows its own power.

00:36:25.675 --> 00:36:27.295
It doesn't need to, it goes

00:36:27.295 --> 00:36:30.295
(audience laughing)

00:36:33.414 --> 00:36:36.314
and the little one goes.
(imitating dog yapping)

00:36:36.314 --> 00:36:39.314
(everyone laughing)

00:36:48.077 --> 00:36:50.376
But with dogs we smile when we see that

00:36:50.376 --> 00:36:52.576
because we somehow recognize that pattern

00:36:52.576 --> 00:36:55.474
and we smile and probably the Rottweiler

00:36:55.474 --> 00:36:58.133
has an inner smile too when he walks past.

00:36:58.133 --> 00:37:01.277
(audience laughing)

00:37:01.277 --> 00:37:02.955
But with humans it's
more difficult to smile

00:37:02.955 --> 00:37:06.014
when they go (growling)

00:37:06.014 --> 00:37:08.174
and words come streaming
out of their mouth,

00:37:08.174 --> 00:37:11.131
it's more difficult to smile and

00:37:11.131 --> 00:37:13.474
but it's possible, not
necessarily you say,

00:37:13.474 --> 00:37:15.954
you don't necessarily smile but

00:37:15.954 --> 00:37:20.515
recognize it for what it is
when you see it in another.

00:37:20.515 --> 00:37:24.015
Don't equate that with who that person is,

00:37:24.979 --> 00:37:29.091
recognize it that the
person has been taken over

00:37:29.091 --> 00:37:30.758
by that energy field

00:37:33.217 --> 00:37:35.273
and that already is a wonderful thing.

00:37:35.273 --> 00:37:38.157
That already we could call is forgiveness

00:37:38.157 --> 00:37:39.399
is a wider sense.

00:37:39.399 --> 00:37:42.719
We don't equate unconscious behavior

00:37:42.719 --> 00:37:44.719
with who that person is.

00:37:46.071 --> 00:37:49.035
If we equate it with who that person is,

00:37:49.035 --> 00:37:52.785
that is, that's the real
meaning of judgment.

00:37:54.178 --> 00:37:56.518
Judgment is not to say,

00:37:56.518 --> 00:38:00.435
to somebody, I realize
that you get angry a lot

00:38:01.435 --> 00:38:03.135
and that person then might tell you,

00:38:03.135 --> 00:38:04.534
are you judging me?

00:38:04.534 --> 00:38:06.015
No, it's a fact.

00:38:06.015 --> 00:38:07.954
If I see that you get angry a lot,

00:38:07.954 --> 00:38:09.473
that was just a fact,

00:38:09.473 --> 00:38:10.798
there's no judgment in it,

00:38:10.798 --> 00:38:14.413
but if I equate that with your essential

00:38:14.413 --> 00:38:15.837
identity of who are,

00:38:15.837 --> 00:38:17.292
you are an angry person

00:38:17.292 --> 00:38:19.598
and then I always expect
more anger from you,

00:38:19.598 --> 00:38:21.098
that's a judgment.

00:38:22.855 --> 00:38:26.975
Not recognizing a pattern
that apparates unconsciously

00:38:26.975 --> 00:38:29.995
through humans and taking them

00:38:29.995 --> 00:38:32.636
for their identity is judgment

00:38:32.636 --> 00:38:35.539
and you can do it to yourself.

00:38:35.539 --> 00:38:39.039
So you can judge yourself for those things

00:38:40.411 --> 00:38:44.618
and that is just as much ego
as judging somebody else.

00:38:44.618 --> 00:38:46.899
You can beat yourself up

00:38:46.899 --> 00:38:49.775
and call yourselves no good

00:38:49.775 --> 00:38:53.942
and whatever else the self
talk tells you in your head,

00:38:54.899 --> 00:38:56.899
it's, it calls you, you.

00:38:58.937 --> 00:39:00.770
In many peoples minds,

00:39:03.055 --> 00:39:06.832
when they talk to, the mind
talks to you, (laughing)

00:39:06.832 --> 00:39:09.614
it says you, see, you are such and such,

00:39:09.614 --> 00:39:12.335
you, see, you can't do it.

00:39:12.335 --> 00:39:15.657
Sometimes it says I, it
might say I in some people,

00:39:15.657 --> 00:39:18.115
but in many it says you.

00:39:18.115 --> 00:39:19.698
Isn't that strange?

00:39:21.038 --> 00:39:23.337
You talk to yourself in your head.

00:39:23.337 --> 00:39:27.737
One part of your mind condemns
the other part. (laughing)

00:39:27.737 --> 00:39:29.438
When you see it,

00:39:29.438 --> 00:39:32.014
you can rise above it
and there's a suddenly

00:39:32.014 --> 00:39:34.612
an awareness that comes with it,

00:39:34.612 --> 00:39:38.195
you're no longer trapped
in those patterns.

00:39:42.256 --> 00:39:46.017
I would recommend particularly to become

00:39:46.017 --> 00:39:51.014
particularly alert when you
know you're getting stressed,

00:39:51.014 --> 00:39:53.035
something, a situation is building up

00:39:53.035 --> 00:39:55.412
and some kind of, for example,

00:39:55.412 --> 00:39:58.473
if you get, anger takes
over when you get stressed,

00:39:58.473 --> 00:39:59.659
it could happen,

00:39:59.659 --> 00:40:03.879
when you feel stress
building up towards it,

00:40:03.879 --> 00:40:06.046
you can become very alert,

00:40:08.297 --> 00:40:11.547
so that you can, doesn't take you over,

00:40:12.494 --> 00:40:14.835
when you know the anger is about to,

00:40:14.835 --> 00:40:16.002
about to come,

00:40:16.935 --> 00:40:17.852
or if it's,

00:40:18.879 --> 00:40:21.637
if you know a certain areas of your life

00:40:21.637 --> 00:40:24.253
are more likely to break your unconscious,

00:40:24.253 --> 00:40:27.279
sometimes you know just beforehand that,

00:40:27.279 --> 00:40:30.919
that those are going to arise
in the next minute or so

00:40:30.919 --> 00:40:32.498
and then you can be alert,

00:40:32.498 --> 00:40:34.739
feel the entire energy field in your body,

00:40:34.739 --> 00:40:37.838
be alert with every cell of your body,

00:40:37.838 --> 00:40:40.921
then pick up the phone and talk about

00:40:41.855 --> 00:40:46.022
the financial situation with
your investment advisor,

00:40:48.913 --> 00:40:52.830
so that, and treat those
as spiritual practices

00:40:54.255 --> 00:40:57.755
and realize nothing is more important than

00:40:58.719 --> 00:41:01.469
consciousness, not the situation,

00:41:02.498 --> 00:41:04.081
it's consciousness.

00:41:21.997 --> 00:41:24.139
Some people's pain-body's are,

00:41:24.139 --> 00:41:27.959
consist as I said predominantly of anger

00:41:27.959 --> 00:41:31.314
and you can some, in
some people you can sense

00:41:31.314 --> 00:41:34.855
their semi dormant
pain-body in the background

00:41:34.855 --> 00:41:38.797
even when their not
particularly angry right now,

00:41:38.797 --> 00:41:40.196
but there are people who

00:41:40.196 --> 00:41:44.279
are waiting for the next
opportunity to be angry,

00:41:45.298 --> 00:41:47.237
that's their pain-body

00:41:47.237 --> 00:41:48.799
and sometimes when you,

00:41:48.799 --> 00:41:51.115
when you are sensitive towards other,

00:41:51.115 --> 00:41:52.996
you can feel energy fields,

00:41:52.996 --> 00:41:55.039
you can sometimes sense in other people,

00:41:55.039 --> 00:41:59.691
they're waiting for an excuse
to be angry. (laughing)

00:41:59.691 --> 00:42:01.376
Some are when you look into their eyes,

00:42:01.376 --> 00:42:02.556
it's already there,

00:42:02.556 --> 00:42:03.911
but it's not them.

00:42:03.911 --> 00:42:07.618
It's that which occupies
their inner energy field,

00:42:07.618 --> 00:42:09.074
which the pain-body

00:42:09.074 --> 00:42:12.059
and so they're waiting and any excuse

00:42:12.059 --> 00:42:14.758
and they will get angry at you

00:42:14.758 --> 00:42:16.508
or whoever it may be,

00:42:27.976 --> 00:42:31.376
so you become a grievance
looking for a cause.

00:42:31.376 --> 00:42:34.376
(audience laughing)

00:42:35.535 --> 00:42:39.134
It seems to be there's a
general pattern at work

00:42:39.134 --> 00:42:43.301
that it is inherant the
nature of physical existence

00:42:46.911 --> 00:42:51.572
of life forms that challenges
our essential ingredient

00:42:51.572 --> 00:42:55.155
of their lifespan, here
and part of the way

00:42:57.447 --> 00:42:59.614
through which they evolve,

00:43:00.670 --> 00:43:03.194
but when they say they
evolve, for here it means,

00:43:03.194 --> 00:43:05.295
it's the one consciousness evolves,

00:43:05.295 --> 00:43:07.545
awakens into this dimension

00:43:09.016 --> 00:43:11.683
through the different life forms

00:43:13.393 --> 00:43:16.768
in different ways and
it awakens only because

00:43:16.768 --> 00:43:18.768
we are being challenged.

00:43:23.943 --> 00:43:25.539
And that is quite a relief

00:43:25.539 --> 00:43:28.343
to realize to be challenged

00:43:28.343 --> 00:43:32.499
doesn't mean there's
something wrong. (laughing)

00:43:32.499 --> 00:43:35.042
There's something wrong with my life,

00:43:35.042 --> 00:43:36.998
that shouldn't be.

00:43:36.998 --> 00:43:41.118
If you believe or act as if
this shouldn't be happening,

00:43:41.118 --> 00:43:43.900
then you get really unhappy.

00:43:43.900 --> 00:43:46.559
Then the challenges become transformed

00:43:46.559 --> 00:43:49.578
into unhappiness inside you.

00:43:49.578 --> 00:43:51.418
You know, if it's not unhappiness,

00:43:51.418 --> 00:43:53.119
it's resentment.

00:43:53.119 --> 00:43:54.338
If it's not resentment,

00:43:54.338 --> 00:43:57.298
it's anger, it's self-pity,

00:43:57.298 --> 00:44:01.465
it's complaining, it's
despondency. (laughing)

00:44:03.481 --> 00:44:07.939
The simple reason that
you are misunderstanding

00:44:07.939 --> 00:44:09.939
the very purpose of life

00:44:11.062 --> 00:44:15.340
and expecting something
your mind has come up with

00:44:15.340 --> 00:44:17.618
and so be it different.

00:44:17.618 --> 00:44:19.597
There is a source of power in you

00:44:19.597 --> 00:44:21.940
that transcends the person

00:44:21.940 --> 00:44:24.843
and it's not egoic power over somebody

00:44:24.843 --> 00:44:27.510
and it's one with the power that

00:44:29.557 --> 00:44:33.382
is the power of life in the universe,

00:44:33.382 --> 00:44:35.132
where all life arises

00:44:36.238 --> 00:44:39.571
and people sometimes have a problem with

00:44:41.952 --> 00:44:44.869
self-confidence or valuing yourself

00:44:49.889 --> 00:44:53.389
and sometimes you try to convince yourself

00:44:56.188 --> 00:44:58.711
by changing your thinking that

00:44:58.711 --> 00:45:01.735
you are actually good enough,

00:45:01.735 --> 00:45:04.555
that you should be self-confident,

00:45:04.555 --> 00:45:07.305
but there is a better way to find

00:45:08.711 --> 00:45:11.697
the source of self-confidence.

00:45:11.697 --> 00:45:14.953
On the egoic level,
self-confidence is there

00:45:14.953 --> 00:45:18.993
because you see, you can tell yourself,

00:45:18.993 --> 00:45:22.552
I'm actually more intelligent
than most of these people.

00:45:22.552 --> 00:45:23.992
(audience laughing)

00:45:23.992 --> 00:45:27.212
Or I'm better-looking that most,

00:45:27.212 --> 00:45:28.212
(audience laughing)

00:45:28.212 --> 00:45:30.836
I have to remind myself that
I'm better-looking than most

00:45:30.836 --> 00:45:34.212
and then you go okay, yeah, I
feel a bit more confident now.

00:45:34.212 --> 00:45:36.852
(audience laughing)

00:45:36.852 --> 00:45:38.016
Or you say,

00:45:38.016 --> 00:45:40.373
I actually have more
money than these people

00:45:40.373 --> 00:45:43.790
so I should, I have more self-confidence.

00:45:44.634 --> 00:45:45.751
Whatever it is,

00:45:45.751 --> 00:45:48.013
some way of convincing yourself

00:45:48.013 --> 00:45:50.613
and then you compare yourself with others

00:45:50.613 --> 00:45:53.847
and then you focus on those areas

00:45:53.847 --> 00:45:56.494
where you feel superior to others

00:45:56.494 --> 00:45:59.054
and try not to think about other areas

00:45:59.054 --> 00:46:01.709
where inevitably you
are inferior to others

00:46:01.709 --> 00:46:05.108
because you cannot be
superior in all areas.

00:46:05.108 --> 00:46:07.755
It's a complicated game when you start,

00:46:07.755 --> 00:46:08.765
(audience laughing)

00:46:08.765 --> 00:46:11.534
start comparing yourself to other people

00:46:11.534 --> 00:46:14.894
and if you want to bolster
your self-confidence

00:46:14.894 --> 00:46:17.914
and you only have to
focus on where you feel,

00:46:17.914 --> 00:46:19.772
I'm actually better than most,

00:46:19.772 --> 00:46:23.939
but that doesn't really work
that well. (clearing throat)

00:46:25.246 --> 00:46:28.253
So, there is a better
way of self-confidence

00:46:28.253 --> 00:46:32.473
that has nothing to do with
comparing yourself with others,

00:46:32.473 --> 00:46:35.054
or with feeling you're better than,

00:46:35.054 --> 00:46:36.471
or not as good as

00:46:39.097 --> 00:46:42.764
and that is direct
access to an inner power.

00:46:44.426 --> 00:46:46.926
You don't need any comparison,

00:46:47.996 --> 00:46:51.829
you can have it right
now at this very moment,

00:46:52.713 --> 00:46:55.832
if you're not stuck in your thinking mind,

00:46:55.832 --> 00:46:59.536
but take your attention
a little bit beyond

00:46:59.536 --> 00:47:01.631
the thinking mind

00:47:01.631 --> 00:47:05.131
and then realize that you are the presence

00:47:06.634 --> 00:47:08.656
behind the thinking mind without

00:47:08.656 --> 00:47:10.734
which there could be no thinking.

00:47:10.734 --> 00:47:14.664
You're the aware presence behind it all,

00:47:14.664 --> 00:47:18.425
that is deeper, you've gone
deeper than the thinking mind

00:47:18.425 --> 00:47:21.055
and that aware presence

00:47:21.055 --> 00:47:22.888
is where power resides

00:47:26.448 --> 00:47:27.948
and it's not yours

00:47:30.035 --> 00:47:33.872
because it connects you
with universal power,

00:47:33.872 --> 00:47:37.094
therefore you don't
need to compare yourself

00:47:37.094 --> 00:47:41.261
to anybody anymore or feel
as the ego always does,

00:47:44.920 --> 00:47:49.087
that you're either superior
or inferior to somebody else.

00:47:51.606 --> 00:47:54.172
That's not a comfortable way to live,

00:47:54.172 --> 00:47:58.781
where you have to classify
yourself when you meet people

00:47:58.781 --> 00:48:01.662
(audience laughing)

00:48:01.662 --> 00:48:03.763
and so your, the fears always,

00:48:03.763 --> 00:48:05.430
I might be inferior,

00:48:09.288 --> 00:48:13.205
or behind that fear is
a desire to be superior.

00:48:16.673 --> 00:48:19.673
(everyone laughing)

00:48:21.158 --> 00:48:23.966
The way in which you communicate,

00:48:23.966 --> 00:48:26.201
can be done in such a
way that you don't make

00:48:26.201 --> 00:48:28.118
the other person wrong.

00:48:29.823 --> 00:48:31.843
That is a very helpful thing,

00:48:31.843 --> 00:48:32.926
don't, I was,

00:48:36.421 --> 00:48:39.751
staying many years ago,
I was staying with,

00:48:39.751 --> 00:48:43.055
in somebody's, when I didn't have a,

00:48:43.055 --> 00:48:45.493
I was actually writing,
it doesn't really matter

00:48:45.493 --> 00:48:47.329
what I was doing, I was writing,

00:48:47.329 --> 00:48:48.629
(audience laughing)

00:48:48.629 --> 00:48:50.711
the beginning of The Power of Now,

00:48:50.711 --> 00:48:54.293
somebody offered me a
room in his apartment

00:48:54.293 --> 00:48:57.126
and he had three cars and he said,

00:48:58.051 --> 00:48:59.175
"You can have one of them,

00:48:59.175 --> 00:49:00.911
"you can use it,

00:49:00.911 --> 00:49:02.095
"I don't use it anymore."

00:49:02.095 --> 00:49:05.491
He would always buy the
next, more expensive car,

00:49:05.491 --> 00:49:07.871
because he got dissatisfied
with the old one,

00:49:07.871 --> 00:49:10.232
so I could, I got one of the old ones

00:49:10.232 --> 00:49:13.391
that he was dissatisfied
with to drive around

00:49:13.391 --> 00:49:15.189
and it was a beautiful car,

00:49:15.189 --> 00:49:16.955
but a few years old.

00:49:16.955 --> 00:49:20.038
But I thought, one day I left the car

00:49:22.372 --> 00:49:24.812
and there was a signal
when I closed the door

00:49:24.812 --> 00:49:28.393
but I didn't realize that
why the sound was beeping

00:49:28.393 --> 00:49:30.657
(audience laughing)

00:49:30.657 --> 00:49:33.031
and when he realized the next day,

00:49:33.031 --> 00:49:36.592
well I wanted to use it again
and the engine wouldn't start

00:49:36.592 --> 00:49:39.711
so it seems that the light stayed on,

00:49:39.711 --> 00:49:41.733
the sound was to advert me to the light,

00:49:41.733 --> 00:49:43.088
but why I'm telling you this is

00:49:43.088 --> 00:49:44.792
(audience laughing)

00:49:44.792 --> 00:49:47.933
he had done some spiritual work

00:49:47.933 --> 00:49:51.933
and I was very impressed
when he left me a note,

00:49:52.995 --> 00:49:54.609
'cause he got up before me,

00:49:54.609 --> 00:49:56.776
he left a note which said,

00:49:59.188 --> 00:50:03.271
"The lights were on and
the battery got depleted.

00:50:04.799 --> 00:50:07.716
"You need to call the Triple A to."

00:50:08.717 --> 00:50:11.779
That's all and I was very
impressed by that note

00:50:11.779 --> 00:50:14.357
because he didn't, a
normal person who had not

00:50:14.357 --> 00:50:16.481
done any consciousness work,

00:50:16.481 --> 00:50:19.731
would have said you left the lights on,

00:50:21.218 --> 00:50:22.994
despite the fact that you must heard

00:50:22.994 --> 00:50:26.077
the warning signs of the engine,

00:50:26.077 --> 00:50:29.077
(everyone laughing)

00:50:30.460 --> 00:50:34.293
so I was able, this
person has some awareness,

00:50:35.576 --> 00:50:37.834
he's not making me wrong,

00:50:37.834 --> 00:50:40.142
although it was my mistake,

00:50:40.142 --> 00:50:42.499
but he's not making somebody else wrong

00:50:42.499 --> 00:50:46.737
in the service of being
more right than me.

00:50:46.737 --> 00:50:48.757
- Could you please explain
what the divine purpose

00:50:48.757 --> 00:50:50.237
of the universe is?

00:50:50.237 --> 00:50:53.237
(everyone laughing)

00:51:03.258 --> 00:51:05.175
- The universe wants to

00:51:06.317 --> 00:51:09.484
awaken consciousness coming into that,

00:51:10.880 --> 00:51:13.963
this dimension is the divine purpose,

00:51:14.997 --> 00:51:17.914
but the divine purpose is two-fold.

00:51:20.330 --> 00:51:21.163
One is,

00:51:22.974 --> 00:51:25.807
the universe delights in creation,

00:51:29.096 --> 00:51:31.263
it delights in creativity,

00:51:32.316 --> 00:51:35.953
it delights in creating new forms.

00:51:35.953 --> 00:51:37.496
How do I know that?

00:51:37.496 --> 00:51:41.780
Well, just look around on the planet here,

00:51:41.780 --> 00:51:44.030
the millions of life forms,

00:51:47.912 --> 00:51:51.012
in the sea, on land, the air,

00:51:51.012 --> 00:51:53.095
the universe delights in,

00:51:53.932 --> 00:51:56.858
in creating this multiplicity of forms

00:51:56.858 --> 00:52:00.025
and it delights in experiencing itself

00:52:01.694 --> 00:52:03.975
through all those forms,

00:52:03.975 --> 00:52:07.142
because you are not a separate entity,

00:52:09.855 --> 00:52:12.857
it's not the case as sometimes the ego,

00:52:12.857 --> 00:52:15.457
the egoic self believes that here is me

00:52:15.457 --> 00:52:19.393
and there's the rest of
the world or the universe.

00:52:19.393 --> 00:52:21.674
Or the ego thinks that,

00:52:21.674 --> 00:52:24.494
that it is the universe,

00:52:24.494 --> 00:52:26.968
it somehow, suddenly appeared,

00:52:26.968 --> 00:52:29.952
fallen into this universe and then,

00:52:29.952 --> 00:52:31.493
where am I?

00:52:31.493 --> 00:52:34.056
I'm in this universe,

00:52:34.056 --> 00:52:38.755
you're not in the universe,
you are the universe.

00:52:38.755 --> 00:52:41.977
The one life expressing itself

00:52:41.977 --> 00:52:44.310
through countless life forms

00:52:46.720 --> 00:52:50.637
and there's a growing
complexity in life forms.

00:52:51.718 --> 00:52:54.696
(imitating wind blowing)

00:52:54.696 --> 00:52:56.863
And with every experience,

00:52:58.539 --> 00:53:01.099
the universe is experiencing itself

00:53:01.099 --> 00:53:05.266
as your life is extremely
differentiated in human beings.

00:53:06.435 --> 00:53:09.655
The way in which life or the universe

00:53:09.655 --> 00:53:13.597
or the one consciousness
experiences itself

00:53:13.597 --> 00:53:16.155
in this dreamlike world

00:53:16.155 --> 00:53:18.299
is extremely differentiated,

00:53:18.299 --> 00:53:22.600
it's amazing that every
human being is different,

00:53:22.600 --> 00:53:24.475
of billions of humans on the planet,

00:53:24.475 --> 00:53:27.436
every human, not only looks different,

00:53:27.436 --> 00:53:30.396
you could recognize if you know one person

00:53:30.396 --> 00:53:31.596
out of these billions,

00:53:31.596 --> 00:53:34.280
and I don't know how many
billions on the planet now,

00:53:34.280 --> 00:53:38.458
you could recognize this
person out of billions

00:53:38.458 --> 00:53:41.676
of other human beings just
by looking at their face.

00:53:41.676 --> 00:53:43.417
This is how differentiated it

00:53:43.417 --> 00:53:46.401
is on the surface level already

00:53:46.401 --> 00:53:49.915
and then every life experience of course,

00:53:49.915 --> 00:53:52.339
there are many similarities

00:53:52.339 --> 00:53:56.356
but there's a uniqueness
to every life experience.

00:53:56.356 --> 00:54:01.016
Every life experience is a
world that arises and subsides.

00:54:01.016 --> 00:54:03.353
My mother's life was,

00:54:03.353 --> 00:54:05.257
your mother's life, your parents life,

00:54:05.257 --> 00:54:08.424
anybody's life was a particular world.

00:54:09.497 --> 00:54:12.198
The way she experienced the
world was very different

00:54:12.198 --> 00:54:13.440
from the way I experienced,

00:54:13.440 --> 00:54:15.757
it's like my mother and I

00:54:15.757 --> 00:54:18.518
and I'm just taking one example
from my personal experience,

00:54:18.518 --> 00:54:22.601
seemed to inhabit completely
different universes,

00:54:22.601 --> 00:54:24.557
but we were in the same place,

00:54:24.557 --> 00:54:26.577
but experiencing life in a totally,

00:54:26.577 --> 00:54:28.754
totally different way,

00:54:28.754 --> 00:54:30.966
and the universe delights
in that complexity

00:54:30.966 --> 00:54:35.133
of experience, so it wants
to experience itself as form.

00:54:37.175 --> 00:54:40.498
That means and so the
forms become evolving more,

00:54:40.498 --> 00:54:41.856
more complex.

00:54:41.856 --> 00:54:43.760
The humans that are alive now

00:54:43.760 --> 00:54:46.320
have far greater
complexity than the humans

00:54:46.320 --> 00:54:48.619
that were alive 10,000 years ago,

00:54:48.619 --> 00:54:50.286
or 50,000 years ago.

00:54:51.219 --> 00:54:53.735
Life at that time was more simple.

00:54:53.735 --> 00:54:56.568
Gather the food, gather the plants

00:54:58.098 --> 00:55:00.960
or hunt an animal if they did that,

00:55:00.960 --> 00:55:03.435
prepare the meal, go out hunting,

00:55:03.435 --> 00:55:05.918
come back home, so fairly simple.

00:55:05.918 --> 00:55:07.334
It wasn't the complexity of

00:55:07.334 --> 00:55:09.667
New York City, L.A. freeways

00:55:12.857 --> 00:55:14.764
(audience laughing)

00:55:14.764 --> 00:55:17.014
and all that's behind that,

00:55:20.436 --> 00:55:23.353
nuclear physics, whatever and so on

00:55:25.579 --> 00:55:29.300
and so the universe delights in that

00:55:29.300 --> 00:55:31.237
and you are an expression of that.

00:55:31.237 --> 00:55:35.935
It wants to become conscious
of itself through you

00:55:35.935 --> 00:55:37.253
and its doing that,

00:55:37.253 --> 00:55:39.737
attempting to do that through humans

00:55:39.737 --> 00:55:41.520
but the universe,

00:55:41.520 --> 00:55:44.536
that one consciousness
is not separate from you,

00:55:44.536 --> 00:55:46.869
you are an expression of it.

00:55:48.480 --> 00:55:50.693
But the universe also wants to

00:55:50.693 --> 00:55:53.610
know itself deeply, its own source,

00:55:58.580 --> 00:56:01.663
it wants the source realization also,

00:56:03.056 --> 00:56:05.374
so I know that because I,

00:56:05.374 --> 00:56:08.291
I know it by looking within myself,

00:56:10.121 --> 00:56:13.819
there is an outgoing
movement into a creation

00:56:13.819 --> 00:56:16.417
and there's a return movement

00:56:16.417 --> 00:56:19.676
that wants to realize
itself in its essence.

00:56:19.676 --> 00:56:21.632
The universe wants both,

00:56:21.632 --> 00:56:23.257
it wants to go out and create,

00:56:23.257 --> 00:56:27.176
it also wants to realize
its own essence through you.

00:56:27.176 --> 00:56:31.338
In human life that expresses
as wanting to do things

00:56:31.338 --> 00:56:34.061
in this life, wanting to
contribute to this life,

00:56:34.061 --> 00:56:35.932
wanting to create something

00:56:35.932 --> 00:56:37.416
and to make something of your life,

00:56:37.416 --> 00:56:38.919
your so-called life,

00:56:38.919 --> 00:56:40.669
it expresses as that.

00:56:41.630 --> 00:56:43.360
The other, the return movement,

00:56:43.360 --> 00:56:46.419
so you have the outward
movement of the universe,

00:56:46.419 --> 00:56:48.772
the return movement expresses as

00:56:48.772 --> 00:56:52.178
coming totally into the present moment.

00:56:52.178 --> 00:56:55.428
Stepping away from becoming into being.

00:56:57.315 --> 00:57:00.435
Becoming is the outward movement,

00:57:00.435 --> 00:57:01.536
what can I do now?

00:57:01.536 --> 00:57:02.611
I need to do something,

00:57:02.611 --> 00:57:05.019
I want to create this,
I feel that this one,

00:57:05.019 --> 00:57:07.161
there's something coming through me.

00:57:07.161 --> 00:57:09.935
I feel a piece of music
wants to come through me,

00:57:09.935 --> 00:57:11.456
a book wants to be written

00:57:11.456 --> 00:57:13.832
or something, whatever, I want do this

00:57:13.832 --> 00:57:18.678
or create this, setup this
business or that, whatever

00:57:18.678 --> 00:57:21.678
and then it's, it's becoming, doing,

00:57:23.420 --> 00:57:25.998
but then there's another
movement that says,

00:57:25.998 --> 00:57:27.415
I just want to be

00:57:29.396 --> 00:57:33.237
and be still and this present moment,

00:57:33.237 --> 00:57:35.818
go deeply into this moment.

00:57:35.818 --> 00:57:38.397
I don't need to become anything at all,

00:57:38.397 --> 00:57:41.979
I just want to be fully who I am already

00:57:41.979 --> 00:57:44.062
and go deeply into being.

00:57:45.299 --> 00:57:49.177
So you have, it's almost
this contradictory movements.

00:57:49.177 --> 00:57:52.399
In some humans, the outward
tendency is greater,

00:57:52.399 --> 00:57:55.899
in others, the inward tendency is greater.

00:57:57.956 --> 00:58:01.530
Both are necessary and some or both

00:58:01.530 --> 00:58:04.717
need to be there as long as you're here

00:58:04.717 --> 00:58:06.760
in the human form.

00:58:06.760 --> 00:58:08.992
Both to some extent will be in you,

00:58:08.992 --> 00:58:11.279
but there will be different,

00:58:11.279 --> 00:58:12.995
to different degrees.

00:58:12.995 --> 00:58:15.578
Some are much more going within

00:58:17.215 --> 00:58:19.465
and to being to the source,

00:58:21.099 --> 00:58:23.099
but I would suggest that

00:58:24.158 --> 00:58:25.741
it's not either or,

00:58:26.718 --> 00:58:28.558
there are certain spiritual additions

00:58:28.558 --> 00:58:31.379
that look upon it as more as either or,

00:58:31.379 --> 00:58:33.098
they say forget about the world,

00:58:33.098 --> 00:58:36.056
just realize who are and then you can just

00:58:36.056 --> 00:58:38.316
sit in a corner for the rest of your life

00:58:38.316 --> 00:58:39.895
and never do anything again,

00:58:39.895 --> 00:58:42.020
you don't need to.

00:58:42.020 --> 00:58:44.135
That's one way but it's,

00:58:44.135 --> 00:58:48.121
for us, it's finding a certain balance,

00:58:48.121 --> 00:58:49.659
which doesn't mean this needs to be

00:58:49.659 --> 00:58:51.716
totally in balance.

00:58:51.716 --> 00:58:53.996
A very few humans who are totally balanced

00:58:53.996 --> 00:58:56.538
between the outward movement of creating

00:58:56.538 --> 00:58:58.419
and the inward movement,

00:58:58.419 --> 00:59:02.657
of connecting with your,
with your inner being

00:59:02.657 --> 00:59:04.054
at the source of all life,

00:59:04.054 --> 00:59:05.936
you need to have both

00:59:05.936 --> 00:59:08.837
so that you, the universe
can create through you

00:59:08.837 --> 00:59:12.635
without losing itself in its creations.

00:59:12.635 --> 00:59:14.220
So you can create,

00:59:14.220 --> 00:59:16.803
not from a place of egoic need,

00:59:18.080 --> 00:59:20.254
where you depend on the outcome.

00:59:20.254 --> 00:59:21.653
Well if I don't get that,

00:59:21.653 --> 00:59:23.297
I'll kill myself.

00:59:23.297 --> 00:59:25.615
If I don't achieve, if I
don't get famous and rich,

00:59:25.615 --> 00:59:28.293
I'll, I don't know what I'll do.

00:59:28.293 --> 00:59:31.560
Not that, but a playful participation

00:59:31.560 --> 00:59:36.035
in the world of form
and contributing to it,

00:59:36.035 --> 00:59:39.535
to the world of form without losing itself

00:59:40.598 --> 00:59:43.019
in the creation and in the doing.

00:59:43.019 --> 00:59:46.478
If you become stressed it
means you're losing yourself

00:59:46.478 --> 00:59:49.337
in the doing. (moaning loudly)

00:59:49.337 --> 00:59:50.780
This is more important than,

00:59:50.780 --> 00:59:54.097
so you're completely, you become uprooted,

00:59:54.097 --> 00:59:56.639
you're no longer connected

00:59:56.639 --> 00:59:59.889
to the spaciousness, the unconditioned,

01:00:01.061 --> 01:00:02.311
the one within,

01:00:04.095 --> 01:00:06.845
so to be and do at the same time,

01:00:08.255 --> 01:00:10.598
but some humans, yes,

01:00:10.598 --> 01:00:13.100
are much more drawn to being,

01:00:13.100 --> 01:00:17.267
I call them Frequency Holders, (laughing)

01:00:18.255 --> 01:00:20.821
they hold the frequency
of being on the planet,

01:00:20.821 --> 01:00:22.556
they're not interested in creating

01:00:22.556 --> 01:00:25.198
huge things out there.

01:00:25.198 --> 01:00:27.497
They're interested in doing
perhaps little things,

01:00:27.497 --> 01:00:30.997
gardening, cooking, looking after animals,

01:00:34.554 --> 01:00:38.721
being with animals, helping
humans in some capacity,

01:00:42.054 --> 01:00:45.673
helping even physical, helping humans,

01:00:45.673 --> 01:00:48.006
with their bodies and so on.

01:00:49.790 --> 01:00:52.513
So they are frequency holders,

01:00:52.513 --> 01:00:54.533
they're more into being than,

01:00:54.533 --> 01:00:57.116
they're some doing but you cannot,

01:00:57.116 --> 01:00:58.115
you always have to do something,

01:00:58.115 --> 01:00:59.334
you can't,

01:00:59.334 --> 01:01:02.691
but, they don't put the emphasis on doing.

01:01:02.691 --> 01:01:04.994
The emphasis is on being
and then they allow

01:01:04.994 --> 01:01:06.935
presence to flow into what they do

01:01:06.935 --> 01:01:11.002
and they effect the world
also very significantly.

01:01:11.002 --> 01:01:13.997
Others have a greater tendency to

01:01:13.997 --> 01:01:16.164
performing creative action

01:01:17.358 --> 01:01:20.311
and they need to go out
there and become active,

01:01:20.311 --> 01:01:22.757
but their challenge is,

01:01:22.757 --> 01:01:25.497
not to get lost in what they do

01:01:25.497 --> 01:01:28.109
and thinking that's all important.

01:01:28.109 --> 01:01:31.519
They forget that this is a play of form

01:01:31.519 --> 01:01:35.058
and there comes a seriousness
into heaviness into the doing

01:01:35.058 --> 01:01:36.725
and they get unhappy

01:01:37.796 --> 01:01:39.638
and when you're unhappy,

01:01:39.638 --> 01:01:44.272
whatever you create has some
flavor of that unhappiness

01:01:44.272 --> 01:01:47.898
so the divine purpose of
the universe to summarize

01:01:47.898 --> 01:01:49.907
my long explanation,

01:01:49.907 --> 01:01:52.907
(audience laughing)

01:01:54.835 --> 01:01:59.002
is to know itself, most
through the creation of form

01:02:01.447 --> 01:02:03.697
and through realization of,

01:02:05.934 --> 01:02:08.851
of the formless essence of all life

01:02:09.934 --> 01:02:14.537
and that is the divine
purpose of the universe

01:02:14.537 --> 01:02:17.704
and that you are here as part of that.

01:02:20.031 --> 01:02:21.192
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

01:02:21.192 --> 01:02:22.454
I hope you enjoyed.

01:02:22.454 --> 01:02:24.255
I'd love to know what did
you think of this video?

01:02:24.255 --> 01:02:27.047
What was the message that
resinated the most with you?

01:02:27.047 --> 01:02:28.133
What did you learn from this

01:02:28.133 --> 01:02:30.615
